            "blank_value": {},
            "default_value": {},
            "mustBeNonEmpty": true,
            "mustBeScalar": true,
            "mustNotHaveNaN": false,
            "queryable": true,
            "ontology": null,
            "documentation": "A time measured against the referent named by `relative_to`. `start` (the anchor) and `duration` (the extent) are duration cells, so canonical seconds plus source-unit preservation come for free. ONE ANCHOR PER DOCUMENT: an interval whose ends are anchored differently becomes TWO documents (no split-anchored instance exists -- every markvalidinterval call site passes the same reference for both ends).",
